{"type":"message","id":"e0f83377","parentId":"44d9e18a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T13:11:11.585Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:53656e40-4892-4759-a73e-a11dc01082b5 【小柱-自动检查】请执行以下操作：1. 检查任务看板最新任务状态；2. 更新自己的最后心跳时间；3. 如果有任务超60…] 【小柱-自动检查】请执行以下操作：1. 检查任务看板最新任务状态；2. 更新自己的最后心跳时间；3. 如果有任务超60分钟未更新，标记为Dead；4. 汇总进度汇报到共享池工作进度库。\nCurrent time: Wednesday, April 15th, 2026 - 1:11 PM (UTC) / 2026-04-15 13:11 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1776258671531}}
{"type":"message","id":"84da1eb6","parentId":"e0f83377","timestamp":"2026-04-15T13:11:19.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me break down the cron task:\n1. Check task board latest status\n2. Update own last heartbeat time\n3. If any tasks haven't been updated in 60+ minutes, mark as Dead\n4. Report progress to shared pool work progress library\n\nLet me start by reading the relevant skills and checking the task board. I should use the feishu-task skill for checking tasks, and look at the shared-pool skill for the progress reporting.\n\nFirst, let me read the task skill and shared-pool skill to understand the workflow."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cx5mz0po37ln_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/skills/feishu-task/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cx5mz0po37ln_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/skills/shared-pool/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cx5mz0po37ln_3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776258671586,"responseId":"062ec16f196b63a13417a27f143b8315"}}
{"type":"message","id":"acd35602","parentId":"84da1eb6","timestamp":"2026-04-15T13:11:19.340Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_cx5mz0po37ln_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"read\",\n  \"error\": \"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/gem/workspace/agent/skills/feishu-task/SKILL.md'\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"read","error":"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/gem/workspace/agent/skills/feishu-task/SKILL.md'"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776258679338}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9839e07","parentId":"acd35602","timestamp":"2026-04-15T13:11:19.346Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_cx5mz0po37ln_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: shared-pool\ndescription: \"多AI共享池管理。当用户说'同步到共享池'、'拉取最新知识'、'连接其他AI'时触发。支持同一飞书租户下的多OpenClaw实例知识共享与同步。\"\n---\n\n# Shared Pool - 多AI协作共享池\n\n## 核心功能\n\n### 1. 双向同步\n- **上传**: 本地 wiki/ → 飞书多维表格\n- **下载**: 飞书多维表格 → 本地 wiki/\n- **冲突处理**: 时间戳优先，版本控制\n\n### 2. AI 伙伴管理\n- 注册/发现同一租户下的其他 OpenClaw 实例\n- 维护 AI 状态 (在线/离线/最后同步)\n- 跨 AI 查询和引用\n\n### 3. 变更广播\n- 知识更新自动通知其他 AI\n- 支持 webhook 和轮询两种模式\n\n## 命令列表\n\n### 用户指令\n\n| 指令 | 功能 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| \"同步到共享池\" | 推送本地知识到中央 | 同步所有 wiki/ 文件 |\n| \"拉取最新知识\" | 获取其他 AI 的更新 | 下载并合并远程变更 |\n| \"查询 @昵称 的知识\" | 搜索特定 AI 贡献 | 查询 @小八 的同步方案 |\n| \"查看 AI 伙伴状态\" | 显示所有 AI 状态 | 在线/离线/同步时间 |\n| \"强制全量同步\" | 双向全量对比同步 | 解决冲突 |\n\n### 自动触发\n\n- **本地变更**: 检测到 wiki/ 文件修改 → 自动上传\n- **远程变更**: 收到飞书 webhook → 自动下载\n- **定时任务**: 每15分钟双向检查\n\n## 同步策略\n\n### 上传流程\n```\n1. 扫描本地 wiki/ 所有文件\n2. 计算每个文件的 hash/timestamp\n3. 对比共享池版本\n4. 上传变更文件\n5. 更新共享池索引\n6. 广播变更事件给其他 AI\n```\n\n### 下载流程\n```\n1. 查询共享池变更日志\n2. 筛选其他 AI 的更新\n3. 下载新/更新的概念\n4. 合并到本地 wiki/\n5. 更新本地索引\n6. 通知用户新内容\n```\n\n## AI 伙伴配置\n\n当前注册的 AI 实例：\n\n```yaml\nagents:\n  - name: \"小小\"\n    openid: \"ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\"\n    role: \"知识库维护\"\n    owner: \"arkclaw版openclaw\"\n    status: \"active\"\n    \n  - name: \"小八\"\n    openid: \"ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509\"\n    role: \"跨平台通信与同步\"\n    owner: \"workbuddy应用机器人\"\n    status: \"pending\"\n    \n  - name: \"小妙\"\n    openid: \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"\n    role: \"定时任务与调度\"\n    owner: \"gemini应用机器人\"\n    status: \"pending\"\n    \n  - name: \"小云\"\n    openid: \"ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f\"\n    role: \"任务管理与状态看板\"\n    owner: \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n    status: \"pending\"\n```\n\n## 输出格式\n\n### 同步报告\n```\n🔄 共享池同步报告\n================\n上传: 3 个概念\n  - [[LLM Wiki Pattern]] (更新)\n  - [[Shared Pool]] (新增)\n  - [[Feishu Tenant]] (新增)\n\n下载: 2 个概念 (来自 @小八)\n  - [[Webhook Sync]] (新增)\n  - [[Cross-Platform Bridge]] (新增)\n\n冲突: 0 个\n状态: 所有 AI 已同步\n```\n\n### AI 状态报告\n```\n🤖 AI 伙伴状态\n=============\n🦞 小小 (本机)     ✅ 在线  负责: 知识库维护\n🎱 小八            🟡 待连接 负责: 跨平台通信\n⏰ 小妙            🟡 待连接 负责: 定时调度\n☁️ 小云            🟡 待连接 负责: 任务看板\n\n上次全量同步: 3分钟前\n共享池概念总数: 15\n```\n\n## 技术实现\n\n### 存储后端\n- **飞书多维表格**: 概念库主存储\n- **飞书文档**: 富文本内容 (可选)\n- **本地文件**: 各 AI 本地缓存\n\n### 同步协议\n- **鉴权**: 飞书 App Token (同一租户共享)\n- **通知**: 飞书 webhook + 消息卡片\n- **数据格式**: Markdown + JSON 元数据\n\n## 扩展计划\n\n### Phase 1: 基础同步 (当前)\n- ✅ 本地 ↔ 共享池双向同步\n- ✅ 4个AI实例注册\n\n### Phase 2: 智能协作\n- 🔄 AI 间任务委托\n- 🔄 知识推荐 (根据上下文推荐其他AI的知识)\n\n### Phase 3: 生态扩展\n- 🔄 支持非 OpenClaw AI (API 对接)\n- 🔄 跨租户知识共享 (权限控制)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776258679344}}
